ng is going well, but gradually the events begin to take on a completely unexpected turn.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108640/extras/8c134fb72f2c60abcbeb692b3707380b.gif?t=1768235667\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1108640/extras/8c134fb72f2c60abcbeb692b3707380b.poster.avif?t=1768235667\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> player decisions have consequences<br></li><li> two romanceable characters<br></li><li> several endings<br></li><li> beautiful CG and author's music</li></ul>",
